def event_night_check_failed: "- Night check failed: checks run automatically on the base branch failed (finished \(.at), \(.url)). This is no team’s PR. Open a ticket in product language (what could change for the user and what is known): `\($orch)/tracker.sh create \($night_ticket) \"<title>\" -`; then leave one line for the morning digest with `\($orch)/digest-note.sh -`. Send no other message.";
